FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://api.manifest.ly/api/v1/

# Manifestly

Utilize your Manifestly Checklists via the API. Each request requires the api_key parameter. Your API Key can be found at <a href="https://app.manifest.ly/profile?section=api">your Manifestly profile page</a>.

Please note: **checklist_id** refers to the **ID of a Workflow** in Manifestly. We renamed checklists to workflows in the user interface, but kept with the same IDs.


## Workflows Collection [/checklists/{?api_key,department_id}]

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + department_id (optional) - Filter list based on department ID of the workflow.

### Create / Update a Workflow [POST]

Create or update a workflow. If the external_id is specified and found, the workflow is updated. Otherwise, a new workflow is created.

If no steps are specified, the steps are not affected.

If steps are specified, existing steps are either updated or deleted (if they are not contained by title in the payload).

Step position is inferred from the order in which steps are specified.

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "business_days": [],
            "description": "We use this when we hire a new employee",
            "expected_duration": 1,
            "expected_duration_units": "week",
            "external_id": "some-external-identifier-001",
            "hide_steps_from_external": false,
            "tag_list": "hr",
            "title": "New Employee",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "title": "Ensure paperwork",
                    "header_step": true
                }
            ]
        }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "checklist": {
                "external_id": "some-external-identifier-001",
                "id": 10345,
                "title": "New Employee",
                "description": "We use this when we hire a new employee",
                "steps": [{
                    "id": 36243,
                    "checklist_id": 10345,
                    "position": 1,
                    "title": "Ensure paperwork",
                    "description": null,
                    "created_at": "2016-03-08T00:04:35.804Z",
                    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T00:05:00.017Z",
                    "header_step": true,
                    "active": true,
                    "original_id": null,
                    "description_with_links": null
                }]
            }

### Deactivate a Workflow [DELETE /checklists/{?api_key,external_id}]

Deactivate a Workflow by specifying its external_id.

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + external_id - External ID of the Active Workflow to deactivate

+ Response 204

+ Response 404

### List All Active Workflows [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "checklists": [{
                "id": 2034,
                "account_id": 851,
                "title": "Blog post promotion",
                "expected_duration": 5,
                "expected_duration_units": "days",
                "description": "Steps to optimize the promotion of a blog post"
              },
              {
                "id": 97,
                "account_id": 851,
                "title": "Weekly Review",
                "expected_duration": 4,
                "expected_duration_units": "hours",
                "description": null
              }, {
                "id": 2348,
                "account_id": 851,
                "title": "Weekly Social Media tasks",
                "expected_duration": 5,
                "expected_duration_units": "days",
                "description": null
              }]
            }

### List All Archived Workflows [GET /checklists/archived]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "checklists": [{
                "id": 4242,
                "title": "Social media tasks v1",
                "expected_duration": null,
                "description": null
              }, {
                "id": 9531,
                "title": "Old post promotion",
                "expected_duration": null,
                "description": null
              }]
            }


## Workflow [/checklists/{checklist_id}/{?api_key}]

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id - A path variable that is required for a valid URL

### Get Workflow Details [GET]

Returns the details of the workflow as well as all the workflow steps and their data settings.

