## Workflow Steps Collection [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps{?api_key}]

### Create a Workflow Step [POST]
You can add a step to a workflow. If position is not specified, the step is appended to the end of the current list of steps.

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id - The workflow ID

+ Attributes
    + header_step - Whether the step contains other steps
    + parent_step_id - Optional ID of the parent step of this step
    + position - The position of the step
    + title - The step title

+ Request (application/json)


    + Body

              {
                "header_step": true,
                "title": "A new header"
              }

+ Response 201 (application/json)


    + Body

              {
                "step": {
                  "active": true,
                  "checklist_id": 97,
                  "id": 514111,
                  "header_step": true,
                  "position": 27
                  "title": "A new header"
                }
              }

### List all Workflow Steps [GET]

Returns a list of active steps for the specified run.

