## Workflow Step [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps/{step_id}/{?api_key}]

Workflow step

+ Parameters

    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id - The workflow ID
    + step_id - The ID of the step

### Show step [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)


    + Body

            {
                "step": {
                    "id": 1373,
                    "active": true,
                    "checklist_id": 97,
                    "header_step": true,
                    "position": 1,
                    "title": "Tasks and Plans"
                }
            }


### Update a Workflow Step [PUT]

+ Attributes
    + header_step - Whether the step contains other steps
    + position - The position of the step
    + title - The step title

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

              {
                  "header_step": false,
                  "position": 1,
                  "title": "Updated title"
                }
              }

+ Response 200 (application/json)


    + Body

              {
                "step": {
                  "checklist_id": 97,
                  "active": true,
                  "header_step": false,
                  "position": 1,
                  "step_id": 1373,
                  "title": "Updated title"
                }
              }

### Delete a Workflow Step [DELETE]

+ Response 204


## Content Objects Collection [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps/{step_id}/content_objects]
Actions on the Content Objects collection for a workflow step.

+ Parameters

    + checklist_id (required, Integer, ``) ... Checklist ID
    + step_id (required, Integer, ``) ... Step ID


### List Content Objects [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)


    + Body

            {
              "content_objects": [
                {
                  "id": 9986,
                  "caption": null,
                  "content": "How well did we do with the stretch goals from last week?",
                  "content_type": "text",
                  "position": 1
                }
              ]
            }

### Create a Content Object [POST]

+ Attributes
    + content - The content
    + position - The position
    + caption - The caption if this is an image or video
    + content_type - One of file, video, text, image

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

              {
                  "content": "This is just a description",
                  "content_type": "text",
                  "position": 1,
                }
              }

+ Response 201 (application/json)


    + Body

              {
                "content_object": {
                  "id": 94734,
                  "caption": null,
                  "content": "This is just a description",
                  "content_type": "text",
                  "position": null
                }
              }


## Content Object [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps/{step_id}/content_objects/{content_object_id}]
Actions on the content object resource

+ Parameters

    + content_object_id (required, Integer, ``) ... Content Object ID

    + checklist_id (required, Integer, ``) ... Checklist ID

    + step_id (required, Integer, ``) ... Step ID


### Show Content Object [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)


    + Body

              {
                "content_object": {
                  "id": 94734,
                  "caption": null,
                  "content": "This is just a description",
                  "content_type": "text",
                  "position": null
                }
              }


### Update Content Object [PUT]

+ Attributes
    + content - The content
    + position - The position
    + caption - The caption if this is an image or video
    + content_type - One of file, video, text, image


+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

              {
                  "caption": null,
                  "content": "This is an even better description",
                  "content_type": "text",
                  "position": 2
                }
              }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "content_object": {
                    "id": 94743,
                    "caption": null,
                    "content": "This is an even better description",
                    "content_type": "text",
                    "position": 2
                }
            }


### Delete Content Object [DELETE]

+ Response 204


## Workflow Hooks [/checklists/{checklist_id}/hooks/{?api_key}]
+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id - The workflow id
### List hooks [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body

            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "id":1,
                        "hookable_id": 15,
                        "hookable_type": "Checklist",
                        "url": "https://yourendpoint.com/hooks",
                        "event": "completed",
                        "created_at": "2020-03-25T22:31:14.683Z",
                        "updated_at": "2020-04-02T16:08:16.565Z"
                    }
                ]
            }
### Create a hook [POST]
+ Attributes
    + event - The event you want to be notified for, available events are "completed", "late", or "started"
    + target_url - The endpoint that we'll notify when the event happens.
+ Response 201 (application/json)
## Workflow delete hook [/checklists/{checklist_id}/hooks/unsubscribe/{?api_key}]
### Delete [POST]
+ Attributes
    + target_url - The endpoint that we'll notify when the event happens.
+ Response 200 (application/json)
## Workflow Step's Hooks [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps/{step_id}/hooks/{?api_key}]
+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id - The workflow id
    + step_id - The step id
### List hooks [GET]
+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body

            {
                "hooks": [
                    {
                        "id":1,
                        "hookable_id": 291,
                        "hookable_type": "Step",
                        "url": "https://yourendpoint.com/hooks",
                        "event": "step_completed",
                        "created_at": "2020-03-25T22:31:14.683Z",
                        "updated_at": "2020-04-02T16:08:16.565Z"
                    }
                ]
            }
### Create a hook [POST]
+ Attributes
    + event - The event you want to be notified for, available events are "step_completed" or "step_late"
    + target_url - The endpoint that we'll notify when the event happens.
+ Response 201 (application/json)
## Delete a Step's Hook [/checklists/{checklist_id}/steps/{step_id}/hooks/unsubscribe/{?api_key}]
### Delete [POST]
+ Attributes
    + target_url - The endpoint that we'll notify when the event happens.
+ Response 200 (application/json)


## Runs Collection [/runs/{?api_key,checklist_id,external_id,status,page,per_page,title}]

### List all Runs [GET]

Returns a list of runs. Includes metadata on pagination, if relevant.

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key
    + checklist_id (optional) - Filter list based on workflow ID.
    + external_id (optional) - Filter list based on external ID.
    + title (optional) - Filter list based on title.
    + status (optional) - Filter list based on status of the run [started, late, completed].
    + per_page (optional) - Number of max records to return per request. Default is 30.
    + page (optional) - Choose which page to return.


+ Response 200 (application/json)

