## Departments Collection [/departments/{?api_key,department_id}]

### List All Departments [GET]
Returns the full list of departments including the master department.

+ Parameters
    + api_key - Your API key


+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "departments": [
                {
                  "id": 6,
                  "master_account_id": 13,
                  "master_account_name": "Testing Account",
                  "name": "Testing Department",
                  "invitation_url": "https://app.manifest.ly/signup/abcde12345",
                  "signup_message": "We're using this for our recurring workflows."
                }
              ]
            }

